## Step 5 Create Domain Controller (DC01)

Open VirtualBox 

Click "New" -> VM Name "DC01" -> VM Folder use default folder -> ISO Image Select ISO image downloaded in step 4 -> leave all other fields 

Uncheck "Proceed with Unattended Installation" we want to install it ourselves as we will add a few things in -> Click "Next"

Base Memory or RAM set to 4096mb, Number of CPUs: 2, Disk Size: 60gb, Click "Next" 

Summary of VM specifications. Verify correct values. 

Go to Adapter and make sure you are in "Expert" mode. Just click on export at top of menu. Adapter 1 should be set to NAT.

Click on Adapter 2 and check the box "Enable Network Adapter". Then go to Attach to and select "Host-Only Ethernet Adapter"




